menu "Universal Node Gateway profile"

config UN_MEMBERSHIP_LIFECYCLE_HOST
    bool "Advertise Membership Lifecycle Host capability"
    default y
    help
        Advertise the existing V2 Membership Lifecycle Host capability.
        This is a Universal Node capability, not a Gateway-specific role.

config UN_GATEWAY_G1A_ENABLE_PRODUCT_TRAFFIC
    bool "Enable Gateway/OTBR product traffic"
    default n
    help
        G1A keeps the canonical Universal Node foundation isolated.  Enabling
        this starts the existing engineering Gateway HTTP carrier and OTBR
        runtime; that is outside the G1A profile.

endmenu
